# What the `shipped` job in .github/workflows/gates.yml asks for, before resolution.
#
# Deliberately NOT the same file as `ci-tests.in`: this job runs the dist-dependent assertions and
# needs no coverage plugin, and a shared file would install the plugin here to save one file.
# The compiled sibling `ci-shipped.txt` is what the job installs.
#
# Regenerate with, from the repository root:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras --output-file=requirements/ci-shipped.txt \
#       requirements/ci-shipped.in
pytest
